   "start": 28.332,
   "dur": 3.96,
   "speechStart": 28.43,
   "speechEnd": 31.453
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "项目方称，已经排除了私钥泄露。",
   "spoken": "项目方称，已经排除了私钥泄漏。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 32.512,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 32.61,
   "speechEnd": 35.026
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "一个月后，Binance 出事，按它的初步报告，路径是这样的。",
   "spoken": "一个月后，Binance 出事，按它的初步报告，路径是这样的。",
