   "start": 67.052,
   "dur": 7.104,
   "speechStart": 67.15,
   "speechEnd": 73.316
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "攻击者不需要私钥，它让签名服务替它签。",
   "spoken": "攻击者不需要私钥，它让签名服务替它签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 74.376,
   "dur": 3.912,
   "speechStart": 74.474,
   "speechEnd": 77.45
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "以太坊上，签出的是 EIP-7702 委托，把热钱包账户的代码，指向攻击者的合约。",
   "spoken": "以太坊上，签出的是 EIP-7702 委托，把热钱包账户的代码，指向攻击者的合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 78.508,
